# Script Modal Confirmation Implementation Spec

## Task 1: Add Script Confirmation Modal HTML Structure
**File:** `server/templates/client.html`
**Location:** After the existing new-idea-modal (around line 520)
**What to create:**
- Add new modal div with id `script-confirmation-modal`
- Include: modal overlay with click-to-close behavior
- Modal content with: script title display, description area, context textarea, cancel/run buttons, error feedback area
**Dependencies:** None
**Approach:**
```html
<div class="modal-overlay" id="script-confirmation-modal" onclick="closeScriptConfirmationModal(event)">
    <div class="modal" onclick="event.stopPropagation()" style="max-width:500px">
        <h3 id="script-modal-title" style="color:#58a6ff;font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem">Run Script</h3>
        <div id="script-modal-description" style="color:#8b949e;font-size:0.85rem;margin-bottom:1rem;display:none"></div>
        <div style="margin-bottom:1rem">
            <label style="display:block;color:#8b949e;font-size:0.8rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem">Additional context (optional)</label>
            <textarea id="script-context-input" placeholder="Additional context for the agent..." style="width:100%;height:80px;background:#0d1117;border:1px solid #30363d;color:#c9d1d9;padding:0.5rem;border-radius:4px;font-family:monospace;font-size:0.8rem;resize:vertical"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div id="script-modal-error" style="color:#f85149;font-size:0.85rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;display:none"></div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:0.5rem;justify-content:flex-end">
            <button onclick="closeScriptConfirmationModal()" style="padding:0.5rem 1rem;background:#21262d;color:#c9d1d9;border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer">Cancel</button>
            <button id="script-run-button" onclick="confirmRunScript()" style="padding:0.5rem 1rem;background:#238636;color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600">Run Script</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
```

